{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/162-si-mu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/162-si-mu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 四牡騑騑，周道倭迟。岂不怀归？王事靡盬，我心伤悲。四牡騑騑，啴啴骆马。岂不怀归？王事靡盬，不遑启处。翩翩者鵻，载飞载下，集于苞栩。王事靡盬，不遑将父。翩翩者鵻，载飞载止，集于苞杞。王事靡盬，不遑将母。驾彼四骆，载骤骎骎。岂不怀归？是用作歌，将母来谂。 · 程俊英、蒋见元 · 注释","description":"雅 · 小雅 · 四牡 · 《詩經注析》关于“四牡騑騑，周道倭迟。岂不怀归？王事靡盬，我心伤悲…”的注脚：这是出使官吏思归的诗。毛序：“劳使臣之来也。”姚际恒《诗经通论》说：“试将此诗平心读去，作使臣自咏极顺，作代使臣咏极不顺。亦因用劳使臣之诗也。”…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"162-si-mu","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","glossId":"0001-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/162-si-mu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1","poem":{"id":"162-si-mu","title":"四牡","categoryId":"ya","subcategoryId":"xiaoya","path":["雅","小雅","四牡"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"四牡騑騑","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"周道倭迟","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"岂不怀归","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"王事靡盬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"我心伤悲","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"四牡騑騑","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"啴啴骆马","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"岂不怀归","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"王事靡盬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"不遑启处","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"翩翩者鵻","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"载飞载下","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"集于苞栩","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"王事靡盬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"不遑将父","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"翩翩者鵻","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"载飞载止","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"集于苞杞","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"王事靡盬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"不遑将母","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"驾彼四骆","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-022","text":"载骤骎骎","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-023","text":"岂不怀归","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-024","text":"是用作歌","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-025","text":"将母来谂","isActive":true}]},